{
  "id": "MRK.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mark 5",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafika ngaphetsheya kolwandle elizweni lamaGerasene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esephumile emkolweni, wamhlangabeza masinyane umuntu ovela emalibeni elomoya omubi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayehlala emalibeni. Kwakungasekho muntu owayengambopha langeketane; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngoba wayebotshiwe kanengi ngezibopho langamaketane, kodwa wawaqamula amaketane, lezibopho waziquma, kwakungasekho loyedwa owayengamthambisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngezikhathi zonke ebusuku lemini wayesemalibeni lezintabeni, ekhala, ezisika ngamatshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ebona uJesu ekhatshana, wagijima, wamkhonza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamemeza ngelizwi elikhulu esithi: Ngilani lawe Jesu, Ndodana kaNkulunkulu oPhezukonke? Ngikufungisa uNkulunkulu, ungangihluphi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba uJesu wathi kuye: Phuma kuye, wena moya omubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasembuza wathi: Ungubani ibizo lakho? Wamphendula wathi: Ibizo lami ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ngoba sibanengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamncenga kakhulu ukuba angabakhuphi kulelolizwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona lapho ewatheni lentaba umhlambi omkhulu wengulube usidla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoya bamncenga bathi: Sithumele engulubeni singene kuzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wabavumela. Omoya ababi baphuma, bangena ezingulubeni; umhlambi waphaphathekela eliweni, waphoseka olwandle, waminzwa, zazingaba zinkulungwane ezimbili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazalusayo babaleka, babika indaba emzini lasemaphandleni; beza ukubona okwenzekileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafika kuJesu, bambona obengenwe ngomoya ababi ehlezi embethe, esilile, yena owayelomoya ababi abanengi; besaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo ababekubonile babatshela ukuba kwenzeke kanjani kowayengenwe ngomoya ababi, langengulube. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebeqala ukumncenga ukuba asuke elizweni lakubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi engena emkolweni, umuntu owayengenwe ngomoya ababi wamncenga ukuba abe laye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamvumelanga, kodwa wathi kuye: Hamba uye ekhaya kwabakini, ubatshele ukuba iNkosi ikwenzele okungakanani, ilesihawu kuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasuka, wahamba, waqala ukutshumayela eDikapolisi ukuba uJesu umenzele okungakanani; bamangala bonke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu esebuye wawelela ngaphetsheya ngomkolo, kwabuthana kuye ixuku elikhulu; wayesolwandle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwafika omunye wabaphathi besinagoge, uJayirosi ibizo lakhe; embona wawa phansi ngasenyaweni zakhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamncenga kakhulu esithi: Indodakazi yami isiphela; akuze, ubeke izandla zakho phezu kwayo ukuze isiliswe, iphile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahamba laye. Ixuku elikhulu lamlandela, lamcindezela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana owayelomopho iminyaka elitshumi lambili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ehluphekile kakhulu enyangeni ezinengi, echithile konke ayelakho engasizakalanga, kodwa kwalokho kumqinisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esezwile ngoJesu, weza exukwini ngemva kwakhe, wathinta ingubo yakhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngoba wathi: Aluba ngithinta ingubo zakhe nje, ngizakusiliswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woma masinyane umthombo wegazi lakhe, wezwa emzimbeni wakhe ukuba usilile esifweni sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wanela ukuzwa phakathi kwakhe ukuba amandla aphumile kuye, waphendukela exukwini, wathi: Ngubani othinte ingubo zami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafundi bakhe bamphendula bathi kuye: Uyabona ixuku likucindezela, kodwa uthi: Ngithintwe ngubani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathalaza ukuba ambone owenze lokhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana esesaba ethuthumela, ekwazi okwenzekileyo kuye, weza wawa phambi kwakhe, wamtshela iqiniso lonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuye: Dade, ukukholwa kwakho kukusilisile; hamba kuhle, usiliswe esifweni sakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi esakhuluma, kwafika abomphathi wesinagoge, bathi: Indodakazi yakho isifile; usamkhathazelani uMfundisi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu engakunanzi okutshiwoyo, wathi kumphathi wesinagoge: Ungesabi, kholwa kuphela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kavumelanga muntu ukuba amlandele, kuphela uPetro, loJakobe, loJohane umfowabo kaJakobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafikake endlini yomphathi wesinagoge, wabona isiphithiphithi labakhalayo labalilayo kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esengenile, wathi kubo: Liphithizelelani, likhala na? Umntwana kafanga, kodwa ulele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamhleka ulunya; kodwa yena esebakhuphile bonke, wathatha uyise womntwana lonina lalabo ababelaye, wangena lapho kulele khona umntwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabamba isandla somntwana, wathi kuye: “Thalitha, kumi”; okuyikuthi ngokuphendulelwa: Ntombazana, ngithi kuwe, vuka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasivuka intombazana masinyane, yahamba; yayileminyaka elitshumi lambili. Bamangala ngokumangala okukhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabalayisisa ukuba lokhu kungaziwa muntu; njalo wathi kayinikwe ukudla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
